  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards Peaceful 2027 Elections in Kenya, an Integrated Online/Offline Approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Towards Peaceful 2027 Elections in Kenya, an Integrated Online/Offline Approach - This measure aims to address emerging tensions and prevent the risk of electoral violence. The action will enhance the ability to identify and respond to societal dynamics around the electoral process through analysis of online discourse. It will also seek to strengthen confidence in the electoral process and encourage civic engagement by actively involving citizens, and youth in particular.</narrative>
  </description>
